    "detailed_description": "Command animal-based factions across planets, moons and space to save the solar system from a cosmic threat! Play as fleet admiral and use your special powers to ensure victory and unite the warring factions.<br><br>Cosmic Critters is a TBS/Tactics game that takes the best of existing titles and mixes it up with new innovative features, Creating ground-breaking gameplay with a competitive ladder, and cross platform support.<br><br>Features Include:<br>- An epic campaign with rougelike elements for unique playthroughs<br>- A deckbuilding/cards system which adds tactical depth and unique playstyles<br>- Multiplayer: Up to 4 players can battle each other, or in teams!<br><br><strong>Note: The game is currently under develop and the name was recently changed, Wishlist to keep updated for closed beta testing and sneak peeks! \ud83d\udc96\ud83d\udc96 </strong>",
    "about_the_game": "Command animal-based factions across planets, moons and space to save the solar system from a cosmic threat! Play as fleet admiral and use your special powers to ensure victory and unite the warring factions.<br><br>Cosmic Critters is a TBS/Tactics game that takes the best of existing titles and mixes it up with new innovative features, Creating ground-breaking gameplay with a competitive ladder, and cross platform support.<br><br>Features Include:<br>- An epic campaign with rougelike elements for unique playthroughs<br>- A deckbuilding/cards system which adds tactical depth and unique playstyles<br>- Multiplayer: Up to 4 players can battle each other, or in teams!<br><br><strong>Note: The game is currently under develop and the name was recently changed, Wishlist to keep updated for closed beta testing and sneak peeks! \ud83d\udc96\ud83d\udc96 </strong>",
    "short_description": "A TBS/Tactics game which adds new mechanics such as Deckbuilding, High ground and a Rougelike campaign to a classic formula\uff01As Fleet Admiral, Your mission is to unite the warring factions against an alien threat!\ud83c\udf0c\ud83d\udc7dPlay as Dogs\ud83d\udc36Cats\ud83d\udc31Birds\ud83d\udc26and Reptiles\ud83e\udd8e to save the solar system! [PC/Handheld]",
